    "name": "Lumina: The Uprising Of Folk Legends",
    "steam_appid": 3597750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/3f1f4f3037d6e3f82e4d014783cb9f55.poster.avif?t=1754688592\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/3f1f4f3037d6e3f82e4d014783cb9f55.webm?t=1754688592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story of tradition and technology, sacrifice and rebirth, and the struggle to protect a world on the brink of unimaginable change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0f04 For generations, Shamans have protected the balance between the physical and spiritual realms, channeling <strong>Lumina</strong>\u2014the vital essence that flows between worlds. But this harmony has been shattered by a powerful corporation seeking to exploit and manipulate this sacred energy for its own gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2e3a A MAGIC WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/7d50a6f6763e49bcee0f054c6601b91d.avif?t=1754688592\" data-has-big width=800 height=271 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pursuit of absolute control over <strong>Lumina</strong> has brought devastating consequences: legendary spirits, once guardians of nature, have been corrupted, and automata infused with spiritual energy now turn against their creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0f04 As destruction spreads, <strong>Thaynara</strong>, a young Shaman descended from two great clans, awakens her rare ability and forges a pact with <strong>Uyara</strong>, a powerful Guardian Spirit who shares her mission. Together, they embark on a journey to restore balance between the realms, battling relentless foes and uncovering the hidden secrets of Lumina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2e3a FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/637340b8c5ca2b89da94cabeccca8c26.poster.avif?t=1754688592\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/637340b8c5ca2b89da94cabeccca8c26.webm?t=1754688592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0f04\u00a0<strong>Lumina</strong> is an action RPG that blends fast-paced combat with exploration in a world where spirituality and progress collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0f04 Face formidable enemies in intense battles, master stylish combos, and unleash powerful abilities alongside Guardian Spirits, each with their own personality and combat style. Develop your skills, upgrade automata, and unravel the mysteries of Shamanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0f04 Travel through breathtaking landscapes of the Spirit Zones and take on colossal foes, from rogue automata and Anima agents to the Great Legends of Folklore. Forge alliances at the Fluminense Academy of Shamanic Arts and explore Rio de Janeiro through supernatural investigation contracts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2e3a\u00a0LIVING LANDSCAPES AWAIT YOU!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/bb73e3c35d037b90c9f12dc2c95cd11c.poster.avif?t=1754688592\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/bb73e3c35d037b90c9f12dc2c95cd11c.webm?t=1754688592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0At the end of this journey, what will remain: hope or destruction?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/974eda9467fedfeb814843d1b661e0f8.avif?t=1754688592\" width=644 height=90 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/3f1f4f3037d6e3f82e4d014783cb9f55.poster.avif?t=1754688592\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/3f1f4f3037d6e3f82e4d014783cb9f55.webm?t=1754688592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story of tradition and technology, sacrifice and rebirth, and the struggle to protect a world on the brink of unimaginable change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0f04 For generations, Shamans have protected the balance between the physical and spiritual realms, channeling <strong>Lumina</strong>\u2014the vital essence that flows between worlds. But this harmony has been shattered by a powerful corporation seeking to exploit and manipulate this sacred energy for its own gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2e3a A MAGIC WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/7d50a6f6763e49bcee0f054c6601b91d.avif?t=1754688592\" data-has-big width=800 height=271 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pursuit of absolute control over <strong>Lumina</strong> has brought devastating consequences: legendary spirits, once guardians of nature, have been corrupted, and automata infused with spiritual energy now turn against their creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0f04 As destruction spreads, <strong>Thaynara</strong>, a young Shaman descended from two great clans, awakens her rare ability and forges a pact with <strong>Uyara</strong>, a powerful Guardian Spirit who shares her mission. Together, they embark on a journey to restore balance between the realms, battling relentless foes and uncovering the hidden secrets of Lumina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2e3a FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/637340b8c5ca2b89da94cabeccca8c26.poster.avif?t=1754688592\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/637340b8c5ca2b89da94cabeccca8c26.webm?t=1754688592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0f04\u00a0<strong>Lumina</strong> is an action RPG that blends fast-paced combat with exploration in a world where spirituality and progress collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0f04 Face formidable enemies in intense battles, master stylish combos, and unleash powerful abilities alongside Guardian Spirits, each with their own personality and combat style. Develop your skills, upgrade automata, and unravel the mysteries of Shamanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0f04 Travel through breathtaking landscapes of the Spirit Zones and take on colossal foes, from rogue automata and Anima agents to the Great Legends of Folklore. Forge alliances at the Fluminense Academy of Shamanic Arts and explore Rio de Janeiro through supernatural investigation contracts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2e3a\u00a0LIVING LANDSCAPES AWAIT YOU!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/bb73e3c35d037b90c9f12dc2c95cd11c.poster.avif?t=1754688592\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/bb73e3c35d037b90c9f12dc2c95cd11c.webm?t=1754688592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0At the end of this journey, what will remain: hope or destruction?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597750/extras/974eda9467fedfeb814843d1b661e0f8.avif?t=1754688592\" width=644 height=90 /></span></p>",
